cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Calcium Imaging (GCaMP) Analysis Workflow — an ELN-integrated, cloud-run pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A self-service workflow for GCaMP calcium-imaging analysis wired into an
  electronic lab notebook (ELN). Scientists upload raw movies through a web
  form; the platform runs Suite2p registration and ROI detection followed by
  trained ROI/spike classifiers and neuron-grouping analysis on cloud GPU, and
  writes auditable results back to the originating experiment.
